{
  "scenario_id": "aidc-lone-chiller-loss-cooling-train",
  "title": "Lone chiller loss in an AIDC cooling train",
  "description": "The only chiller of a row fails. Its fault is unabsorbed into the row's chilled-water service, but the N+1 chilled-water pump pair absorbs the cascade at the CDU: the fault stops at the redundant pump group, so cooling and IT services are not exposed by this single fault. Pins the AIDC cooling-train semantics the corpus uses (absorption at the first redundant downstream group).",
